            "notes": "(*\ud83d\udfe9= buy,\ud83d\udfe5= sell,\ud83d\udfe7= sell if if you can't afford all\ud83d\udfe9items,\u2b1c= keep*)\n\n## \u2328\ufe0f GAMEPLAY ##\n\nFor the most part, continue to play in the same way that you have been. However, if you see a squishy target out of position and/or low on health, feel free to go in for a quick try for a kill using the extra [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) from [Vivace](item_bde9f357-b950-4bde-94d1-3d2e472278a9) to create a numbers advantage, but you must **stay aware of how much you're diving and never leave your team without healing for any extended period of time.** Avoid dives where possible when the second supports is dead/not with the team.\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf TARGET ITEMS ##\n\n- \ud83d\udfe9[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n- \u2b1c[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n- \u2b1c[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 RECCOMENDED EXTRAS ##\n\n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6)\n- [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2)",
