            "notes": "(*\ud83d\udfe9= buy,\ud83d\udfe5= sell,\ud83d\udfe7= sell if if you can't afford all\ud83d\udfe9items,\u2b1c= keep*)\n\n## \u2328\ufe0f GAMEPLAY ##\n\nI think you know the drill by now. [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) makes it significantly easier to charge [Sound Barrier](ability_2af0b9c0-5955-420b-bb09-b27de58a4232) and also boosts [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and base healing even further.\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf TARGET ITEMS ##\n- \ud83d\udfe9[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)\n- \u2b1c[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)\n- \u2b1c[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)\n- \u2b1c[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n- \u2b1c[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97)\n- \ud83d\udfe7[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n- \ud83d\udfe5[Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 RECCOMENDED EXTRAS ##\n- [Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575)",
