            "notes": "(*\ud83d\udfe9= buy,\ud83d\udfe5= sell,\ud83d\udfe7= sell if if you can't afford all\ud83d\udfe9/\u2b1citems,\u2b1c= keep*)\n\n## \u2328\ufe0f GAMEPLAY ##\n\nOne final time, although this time a lot faster, make your dives and keep up the funds for BigHealing Corp. Call me crazy, but for maximum fun, and suprisingly decent survivability value, I like to drop [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) for [Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575), especially if [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) has been built by the enemy dps at this point in the game. The double jump on [Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575) is just super fun tbh and combined with [Vivace](item_bde9f357-b950-4bde-94d1-3d2e472278a9) you are practically Barry Allen and you are more than capable of ragebaiting the enemy team in the name of the Lucio Mafia \ud83e\udd2a.\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf TARGET ITEMS ##\n- \ud83d\udfe9\ud83d\udfe7[Hip Hop](item_131ccc82-3545-407a-ba57-5f7602d34575)\n- \u2b1c[Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4)\n- \u2b1c[Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e)\n- \u2b1c[Three-Tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429)\n- \u2b1c[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8)\n- \u2b1c[#1 Single](item_5c5d5331-2966-440b-b989-aa92187eef97)\n- \ud83d\udfe5[Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016)\n\n## \ud83d\udcc8 RECCOMENDED EXTRAS ##\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce)\n- [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4)",
